{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22685","headline":"荅谢家最小偏怜女 · 白居易","name":"荅谢家最小偏怜女","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"嫁得梁鸿六七年，耽书爱酒日高眠。\n雨荒春圃唯生草，雪压朝厨未有烟。\n身病忧来缘女少，家贫忘却爲夫贤。\n谁知厚俸今无分，枉向秋风吹纸钱。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22685.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22685","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}